This follows from the $\ell^2$ bound coming from Parseval's identity.

\begin{align*}
\#\Bigl\{0\le a<X:\Bigl|S_{\mathcal{R}}\Bigl(\frac{a}{X}\Bigr)\Bigr|\ge\frac{X}{10C}\Bigr\}
&\ll \frac{C^{2}}{X^2}\sum_{a<X}\Bigl|S_{\mathcal{R}}\Bigl(\frac{a}{X}\Bigr)\Bigr|^2\\
&=\frac{C^2}{X}\sum_{n<X}\Lambda_{\mathcal{R}}(n)^2\\
&\ll C^2(\log{X})^{O_\eta(1)}.\qedhere
