The first bound on the size of $\mathcal{E}$ follows from using Lemma \ref{lmm:DigitDistribution} with $B=X^{23/80}$ and verifying that $(23\times 235)/(80\times 154)+59/433<23/40$. For the second bound we see from Lemma \ref{lmm:DigitDistribution} that
\begin{align*}
\sum_{a\in\mathcal{E}} F_X\Bigl(\frac{a}{X}\Bigr)
